    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong>Box&nbsp;16.07</strong> 2020 criteria for hereditary gastric and breast cancer syndrome (HGBCS) genetic testing <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{32758476}</span></p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Adapted from Blair VR, McLeod M, Carneiro F, et al. Hereditary diffuse gastric cancer: updated clinical practice guidelines. Lancet Oncol. 2020 Aug;21(8):e386-e397. PMID: 32758476. ",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 446.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"595\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Family criteria</span></strong><sup><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">a</span></sup></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 23.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&ge;&nbsp;2&nbsp;cases of gastric cancer in family regardless of age, with at least one DGC</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 23.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&ge;&nbsp;1&nbsp;case of DGC at any age and &ge;&nbsp;1&nbsp;case of LBC &lt;&nbsp;70&nbsp;years in different family members</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 23.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&ge;&nbsp;2&nbsp;cases of LBC in family members &lt;&nbsp;50&nbsp;years</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Individual criteria</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 23.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">DGC at age &lt;&nbsp;50&nbsp;years</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 23.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">DGC at any age in individuals of Māori ethnicity</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 23.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">DGC at any age in individuals with a personal or family history (first degree) of cleft lip&nbsp;/ cleft palate</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 8; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 23.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">History of DGC and LBC, both diagnosed &lt;&nbsp;70&nbsp;years</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 9; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 23.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Bilateral LBC, diagnosed &lt;&nbsp;70&nbsp;years</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 10; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 23.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Gastric in&nbsp;situ signet-ring cells and/or pagetoid spread of signet-ring cells</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 11; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">CDH1</span></em><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\"> testing is recommended when one of the above criteria has been met and cancer diagnosis has been confirmed. Histologically confirmed intestinal-type gastric cancer and non-LBC cases should not be used to fulfil testing criteria as these are not part of HGBCS. Individuals who fulfil criteria for genetic testing but are found to be negative for a <em>CDH1</em> variant should be subsequently tested for <em>CTNNA1</em>.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">DGC, diffuse-type gastric cancer; LBC, lobular breast cancer.</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><sup>a</sup>Family members must be first- or second-degree blood relatives of each other. Where possible, test an affected person. If there are no living affected relatives, consider tissue testing (tumour or normal) from an affected deceased relative. If these options are not possible, consider indirect testing in unaffected family members.</p>",
    "imageUrl": null,
    "thumbnail": null
  },
